// ── MaglevGraphBuilder (字节码→图; 父子 KNA/VO 借用: Take/Move 成对) ──
//   BuildGraph(info, osr_offset); known_node_aspects(); 内联时 BorrowParent* 守卫

// ── MaglevReducer (concept 约束族: WithKNA/WithKNASetter/WithEagerDeopt/WithLoopEffectTracking…) ──
//   修订转 Rust trait bound; MaglevReducer 本体在 passes 侧被各 Processor 组合

// ── 内联 + 剥循环 (Phase kInlining/kLoopPeeling) ──
//   MaglevCompilationUnit::New/NewInner/NewDummy (顶层/内联/哑单元); is_inline()=depth!=0
//   MaglevLoopPeeler; MaglevLoopPeelInfo 登记在 Graph 侧

// ── KNA (KnownNodeAspects: map 推断 + 循环头 MergeForLoop/IsCompatibleWithLoopHeader) ──
//   RecomputeKnownNodeAspectsProcessor (优化器/KNA 重算共用); MapInference (单点 map 折叠)
//   InterpreterFrameState: Take/Clone/Clear/MergeNodeAspects (merge 块状态机)

// ── MaglevCompilationInfo (顶层编译参数; OSR 经 toplevel unit) ──

// 对数: builder 5 + reducer 3 + kna 4 + unit 3 + frame 3 + peeler 1 + info/map 2 全过
